  "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a young girl dressed in a white dress, with red stains resembling blood on her face and clothing, holding an apple. The text overlay reads: 'only israelis can knocks the teeth out of a 6 yr old girl.' This meme uses a violent and graphic visual to make a sweeping, hateful generalization about Israelis, implying they are uniquely capable of committing a horrific act against a child. The juxtaposition of the innocent-looking child with the violent imagery and the antisemitic stereotype (blood libel variation) is designed to provoke outrage and target a specific ethnic/religious group. The intent is to spread hatred and misinformation by associating Israelis with extreme violence against children, which is a harmful and hateful stereotype rooted in antisemitic tropes.",
